{

 "name": "Flutter Aula - Editor de Docs",

 "image": "ghcr.io/cirruslabs/flutter:stable",

 "forwardPorts": [8080],

 "portsAttributes": {

  "8080": {

   "label": "App Flutter",

   "onAutoForward": "openPreview"

  }

 },

 "customizations": {

  "vscode": {

   "extensions": [

    "Dart-Code.flutter",

    "Dart-Code.dart-code"

   ]

  }

 }

}



Arquivo 2: .vscode/launch.json(Configura o atalho F5 para rodar o aplicativo em modo servidor web sem precisar configurar portas manualmente)



{

 "version": "0.2.0",

 "configurations": [

  {

   "name": "Rodar App Flutter (Web Preview)",

   "request": "launch",

   "type": "dart",

   "args": [

    "-d",

    "web-server",

    "--web-port",

    "8080",

    "--web-hostname",

    "0.0.0.0"

   ]

  }

 ]

}

